### POST neues Item
POST http://localhost:8080/item
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sneaker",
  "category": "Schuhe",
  "amount": "1 Paar",
  "shop": "Nike",
  "url": "https://shop.de/nike",
  "price": 89.99,
  "priority": "hoch",
  "status": "Zu kaufen",
  "purchased": false

}
