### POST neues Item für DM
POST http://localhost:8080/item
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shampoo",
  "category": "Drogerie",
  "amount": "1 Stück",
  "shop": "DM",
  "url": "",
  "price": 2.99,
  "priority": "mittel",
  "status": "Zu kaufen",
